# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
**/target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# LLVM coverage profiles (local runs only; CI uploads lcov fragments)
**/*.profraw
# Local lcov reports (CI uploads fragments; never commit these)
lcov-*.info
lcov-*/
coverage/

**/.DS_Store
.vscode/ipch
**/*.*~
**/#*.*#

# GBA ROM test byproducts (regenerated on every run; refs/ stays tracked)
roms/gba/diffs/
roms/gba/screenshots/
# Save-state sidecars created by manual/RPA runs (regenerated on demand)
*.states/
